                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Sorry I missed your question.\n\n1. I\u2019ll defeat Trump.\n2. Laser focused economic policy on affordability.\n3. All hands on deck housing production initiative to eliminate homelessness in America.\n4. Codify women\u2019s reproductive freedom into law.\n5. Pass national health insurance legislation to include mental/emotional health coverage so that no American incurs medical debt or goes bankrupt any longer.\n6. Legalize cannabis and reschedule psilocybin.\n7. Change asylum laws to keep migrants safe and reduce chaos at our southern border.\n8. Lead with courage and the daily intention to repair and bring peace to America and the world.",
