                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": ".@ianbremmer nails it. To fix it:\n\nNat\u2019l health insurance for all, convert fee for service to capitation, & preclude the sale of any pharmaceutical at a price higher than those offered to Canada, Japan, France, the UK, etc.\n\nWe\u2019ll spend less by moving from sick care to health care.",
