                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Medicare For All is a centrist, common sense solution to our unaffordable sick care disaster.\n\nWith 26mm uninsured, 90mm underinsured, the highest prices in the world, and mid-pack outcomes - we should be embarrassed.\n\nWe ensure public education for all and must ensure health coverage for all. Period.",
