                "text": "New Year\u2019s Wishes:\n\nPeace among Americans and nations of the world, and an end to war and bloodshed.\n\nGood health to President Biden as he navigates crises at home and abroad.\n\nMore repair, reconnection, and reinvigoration, and less hate, anger, and antagonism.",
