                "reply_count": 28,
                "retweet_count": 20,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Another installment of 15 With Dean w/@Jason.\n\nThis time we discuss the American sickcare \"system\", for which we pay 2x more than any other nation, 3-5x more for prescription drugs, and generates only mid-pack health outcomes.\n\nIt's time for universal national health insurance and real competition among health systems to keep us healthy - not just treat us when we get sick. (If we're so lucky.)",
