                "text": "Chronic homelessness has doubled since 2016.\n\nIt\u2019s inexcusable, inhumane, and a solvable problem requiring bold leadership.\n\nProduce housing, reduce red tape & zoning hurdles, mental + physical health coverage for all, treatment + recovery programming, & targeted guaranteed income.",
