                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "In 1994, middle class Americans held 2x more wealth than the top 1%.\n\nIn 2024, middle class Americans hold LESS wealth than the top 1%, and it\u2019s getting worse.\n\nIt\u2019s time for new leadership, American Dream Accounts, debt-free, PreK-college education, National Health Insurance, and 7m new homes.\n\nWe can do it. And we must.",
