                "retweet_count": 23,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Kudos to the Biden Administration for strong macro economic growth.\n\nI\u2019ll focus on ensuring more of that growth accrues to the 60% of Americans living paycheck to paycheck and 40% with < $400 in the bank.\n\n\u27a1\ufe0fAmerican Dream Accounts, Nat\u2019l Health Insurance, Debt Free Education, UBI pilots, and 7 million new homes. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8",
