                "reply_count": 122,
                "retweet_count": 26,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "We\u2019ve had many years to anticipate the blessings and curses of AI - on our economy, in medicine, and in society - and Europe has already passed its AI Act.\n\nAs President, I\u2019ll lead the AI Century by enabling innovation, preparing our workforce and economy, pursuing cost savings, and ensuring robust guardrails are in place to protect our kids, our elections, and our security.",
