                "quoted_status_profile_username": "JeromeAdamsMD",
                "reply_count": 123,
                "retweet_count": 42,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "It\u2019s inexcusable that medical debt is the leading cause of bankruptcy in America.\n\nThe case for National Health Insurance is clear: reduce costs, increase wellness, and rectify injustice.\n\nAchieving healthcare for all must become a priority of our generation.",
                "text_lang": "en",
