                "text": "Hello, Michiganders! \ud83d\udc4b A vote for me tomorrow is a vote for peace and for a bright future.\n\nIt\u2019s a vote for investing in the health, education, and opportunity for our children, and protecting reproductive rights & LGBTQ+ Americans.\n\nAnd a vote to defeat Donald Trump. \nhttps://t.co/zCit2vOdvF",
