                "text": "All we have to do is listen.\n\nTo the 60% of our neighbors living paycheck to paycheck, to all repulsed by bloodshed abroad and the human and nat\u2019l security crisis at our border, to the 25 million lacking health insurance, and to all the young Americans who feel unheard and unappreciated by our government.",
