                "text": "Q: If we will allocate $895b to defend America (as we did today), why won't we defend 100 million Americans who've amassed $200b in medical debt - 500,000 of whom will declare bankruptcy this year because of it?\n\nA: Because the defense lobby spreads a whole lot more cash around Congress than the indebted patient lobby. https://t.co/XZwq1NGvIc",
